sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / Dashboard
    participant KAPI as kube-apiserver<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant WH as odh-model-controller webhook<br/>Service 443 → 9443/TCP TLS
    participant Mgr as odh-model-controller reconcilers<br/>SA odh-model-controller
    participant Router as OpenShift Router<br/>443/TCP
    participant Pred as Predictor (kube-rbac-proxy)
    participant DashBE as RHOAI Dashboard backend
    participant MSA as model-serving-api<br/>Service 443 → 8443/TCP TLS 1.2+
    participant NGC as NVIDIA NGC / nvcr.io<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant GWE as Gateway (Envoy) + Authorino<br/>443/TCP
    participant LLMD as llm-d EPP / vLLM

    Note over User,Pred: Flow 1 - InferenceService creation (raw deployment with Route)
    User->>KAPI: Create InferenceService<br/>HTTPS 6443, User token
    KAPI->>WH: POST /mutate + /validate ISVC<br/>HTTPS 9443, admission (cluster TLS profile)
    WH-->>KAPI: Patched / allowed (failurePolicy Fail)
    Mgr->>KAPI: Watch ISVC, create Route, SA, CRB,<br/>NetworkPolicy, ServiceMonitor, KEDA TriggerAuth<br/>HTTPS 6443, SA token
    User->>Router: HTTPS 443 inference request<br/>Bearer token
    Router->>Pred: TLS reencrypt
    Pred-->>User: Prediction response

    Note over DashBE,MSA: Flow 2 - Dashboard Gateway discovery
    DashBE->>MSA: GET /api/v1/gateways<br/>HTTPS 443→8443, User Bearer token
    MSA->>KAPI: List Gateways<br/>HTTPS 6443, model-serving-api SA token
    MSA->>KAPI: SelfSubjectAccessReview per namespace<br/>HTTPS 6443, User token
    KAPI-->>MSA: Allowed namespaces
    MSA-->>DashBE: Filtered Gateway list (JSON)

    Note over User,NGC: Flow 3 - NIM Account enablement
    User->>KAPI: Create Account + NGC API key Secret<br/>HTTPS 6443, User token
    KAPI->>WH: POST /validate-nim-opendatahub-io-v1-account<br/>HTTPS 9443 (singleton check)
    Mgr->>NGC: Validate key, catalog, manifests<br/>HTTPS 443, NGC API key (Bearer / Basic $oauthtoken)
    NGC-->>Mgr: Validation + metadata
    Mgr->>KAPI: Create Templates, ConfigMaps, pull Secret,<br/>update Account status (SA token)

    Note over KAPI,LLMD: Flow 4 - LLMInferenceService on Gateway
    KAPI->>WH: POST /mutate + /validate LLMISVC<br/>HTTPS 9443, ConnectionsAPI + DRA
    Mgr->>KAPI: Create EnvoyFilter, AuthPolicy, Roles,<br/>NetworkPolicies, Grid InferenceProvider (SA token)
    User->>GWE: HTTPS 443 inference request<br/>Bearer token
    GWE->>GWE: Authorino validates via Kuadrant AuthPolicy
    GWE->>LLMD: Forward to EPP / vLLM
    LLMD-->>User: Completion response
